 {:n 1,
  :page "walk-1",
  :step 3,
  :note
  "Act 1: stamp.clj as it was at bb6b6cc1 (the parent of 0e6182b9), instance cut A: file, namespace and eight definitions as entities; readable-keyword keys. Instance values: every id and key (decision 2), :session (decision 4).",
